は日常着れるラフな格好でお願いします。\n資料はイメージなので描きやすいようにしてください\n\n使用用途\nTRPG立ち絵\n個人観賞用印刷\n\nよろしくお願いします\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1G33P0xh3rdTpQwGfd7PqgnxcjRHJ32L_", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ryoto_328/works/22", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d31f1ee6/uploads/origins/e92def42-29c5-4df8-bf21-614d7ee7773c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=af493f6800a2f28dc03ca339f44f1f60", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d31f1ee6/uploads/origins/e92def42-29c5-4df8-bf21-614d7ee7773c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=af493f6800a2f28dc03ca339f44f1f60, https://si.imgix.net/d31f1ee6/uploads/origins/e92def42-29c5-4df8-bf21-614d7ee7773c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2258fe45737614342f095fa6b32a9a42 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d31f1ee6/uploads/origins/e92def42-29c5-4df8-bf21-614d7ee7773c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=54c737c33951b32cdf1831f8b5e8a70d 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "再送すみません！！！\nシチュエーションその他問いませんので、感じたふうにお描きください♪", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@ryoto_328/works/21", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d3c0692a/uploads/origins/fa0c44bc-66c4-4db0-a782-e1cda27e87c1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eff71e6dee4b485e9c46d757cfec7170", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d3c0692a/uploads/origins/fa0c44bc-66c4-4db0-a782-e1cda27e87c1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eff71e6dee4b485e9c46d757cfec7170, https://si.imgix.net/d3c0692a/uploads/origins/fa0c44bc-66c4-4db0-a782-e1cda27e87c1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b0ddbfebee7ec37620895f090cf6ed4f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d3c0692a/uploads/origins/fa0c44bc-66c4-4db0-a782-e1cda27e87c1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1a08